  "_comment": "Analysis request clusters (N6). Frames are dealt in shuffled rounds so no opening dominates (I20). Titles and descriptions combine a subject phrase, a scope phrase and a purpose, so requests about the same thing are worded differently. related_subjects point at report subjects a finished request can result in. Purposes are prepositional phrases so they read correctly in every frame.",
